Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.00,0:00:52.75,Hdr,,0,0,0,,October 11, 1998 - Mainichi Okan
Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.80,0:00:01.90,Cap,,0,0,0,,Past the 600 marker
Dialogue: 0,0:00:01.90,0:00:04.50,Cap,,0,0,0,,The speedster Silence Suzuka out in front
Dialogue: 0,0:00:04.50,0:00:07.40,Cap,,0,0,0,,And outside, the chestnut monster Grass Wonder
Dialogue: 0,0:00:07.40,0:00:12.00,Cap,,0,0,0,,Right behind, the unbeaten import El Condor Pasa is chasing
Dialogue: 0,0:00:12.00,0:00:14.40,Cap,,0,0,0,,Silence Suzuka leads - still going, still going
Dialogue: 0,0:00:14.40,0:00:17.10,Cap,,0,0,0,,Grass Wonder second, Big Sunday on his inside
Dialogue: 0,0:00:17.10,0:00:19.80,Cap,,0,0,0,,El Condor Pasa is closing from the outside
Dialogue: 0,0:00:19.80,0:00:21.90,Cap,,0,0,0,,But Silence Suzuka is still in front
Dialogue: 0,0:00:21.90,0:00:24.70,Cap,,0,0,0,,Up the hill - can he lead all the way again?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:24.70,0:00:26.90,Cap,,0,0,0,,El Condor Pasa moves up to second
Dialogue: 0,0:00:26.90,0:00:30.40,Cap,,0,0,0,,Grass Wonder third - Grass Wonder looks in trouble
Dialogue: 0,0:00:30.40,0:00:34.80,Cap,,0,0,0,,Big Sunday inside - but Silence Suzuka is out on his own again
Dialogue: 0,0:00:34.80,0:00:38.90,Cap,,0,0,0,,El Condor Pasa second - Grass Wonder drops from third to fourth
Dialogue: 0,0:00:38.90,0:00:43.20,Cap,,0,0,0,,Silence Suzuka - wire to wire again, a dominant win!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:43.20,0:00:48.10,Cap,,0,0,0,,A solo show - Silence Suzuka brushes aside the best of the 3-year-olds
Dialogue: 0,0:00:48.10,0:00:51.10,Cap,,0,0,0,,A brilliant run - now on to the big autumn stage!